"""
HabitLoop Skill — Read/write habit data via Supabase.

Setup:
  1. Copy .env.example to .env and fill in credentials
  2. Run: habits link
  3. Enter token in app: Settings → Link Agent

Usage:
  habits list              # 습관 목록
  habits summary           # streak/완료 통계
  habits entries [--days N] # 최근 기록
  habits check <name> YES  # 체크 (부분 매치)
  habits check <name> NO   # 언체크
  habits status            # 앱 vs DB 상태
  habits coach "메시지"     # 코칭 메시지
  habits link              # device 연결
  habits whoami            # 연결 정보
"""

